# choices: 0,0
# story: 06_tags_as_commands.ink

The old well sits in the village square.
Alfoz the tinker leans against its stones.
"Fancy a look at my wares, traveler?"
>>> Show me
Alfoz spreads a cloth of trinkets.
A brass compass catches the light.
The needle always points home, he claims.
"Five coins and it's yours."
>>> Buy the compass
Coins change hands.
"Safe travels," Alfoz says.
